  "bodyHtml": "\n\t\n\t<div class=\"col-md-8\">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-image-area\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-title-date no-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>First Day of Holiday Ornament Sale During Black Friday</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tecset-date\"><span class=\"tribe-event-date-start\">November 14, 2025 @ 8:00 am</span> - <span class=\"tribe-event-time\">5:00 pm</span></div>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-light-bg\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-content-area\">\n\t\t   \t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-event-description tribe-events-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists’ annual holiday miniature ornament sale is a popular attraction that raises money for two local children’s charities.  This year the hand-painted miniature ornaments will be on sale Black Friday, 11am to 8pm and weekends through December 21, 11am to 4pm.  The Art Gallery will also be open 5-8pm during the Christmas Stroll in Harwich Port on Friday, December 5.  Public parking across the street.  The Gallery is located at</p>\n<p>Over 200 hand painted miniature oil canvases and framed watercolor paintings by members of the Guild are available at $20 each.  Many of the ornaments are inspired by holiday images of Cape Cod and make wonderful stocking stuffers. Proceeds of this year’s ornaments sale will be split between <strong>The Children’s Center, </strong>a part of Harwich Ecumenical Council for the Homeless, and the <strong>Harwich Children’s Fund</strong>.</p>\n\n\n\t\t\t </div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-map-area\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"col-md-4\">\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-sidebar-area\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-sidebar-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-past-event-notice\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-notices\"><ul><li>This event has passed.</li></ul></div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-s